@startuml
title Feature 002 - Domain and Logical Responsibilities (DRAFT)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class Activity {
  id / phase / currentQuestionNumber
  teacher stateRevision
}
class Question {
  number / started / closed
}
class Submission {
  groupNumber / answerText / receiveRank
}
class Group
class Session {
  role / binding
  studentViewRevision
}
class GuidedNotesSource {
  spreadsheet identity / title
  supported and excluded sheets
  imported structure baseline
  write permission confirmation status (not a guarantee)
}
class PlaceholderLocation {
  questionNumber / stable sheet identity
  sheet title / row / column / address
  originalPlaceholder / structure checks
}
class ClosedWinnerSnapshot <<immutable>> {
  activityId / source identity
  closed winner text + copied locations
}
class WritebackOperation {
  original snapshot / per-target expected text
  running / pending verification
  verified / failed / conflict
}
class WritebackEvidence {
  source / location / exact text
  verified for this activity
}
class GuidedNotesService {
  validateSourceAndPlaceholders()
}
class WritebackCoordinator {
  captureClosedWinners()
  preflightAllTargets()
  reconcileOriginalOperation()
  verifyWrittenValues()
}
class SheetsAccess {
  readAuthorizedSource()
  writeOnlyEligibleCellValues()
}
class AuthorizationService
class ActivityService
class SubmissionService
class SynchronizationService
class RuntimeStore
Activity "1" *-- "1..*" Question
Activity "1" *-- "1..*" Group
Question "1" *-- "0..*" Submission
Group "1" -- "0..*" Submission
Group "0..1" -- "0..1" Session : student binding
Activity "1" *-- "1" GuidedNotesSource
GuidedNotesSource "1" *-- "1..*" PlaceholderLocation
Question "1" --> "1" PlaceholderLocation
Activity "1" *-- "0..*" WritebackOperation
Activity "1" *-- "0..*" WritebackEvidence
WritebackOperation "1" *-- "1" ClosedWinnerSnapshot
WritebackCoordinator ..> AuthorizationService
WritebackCoordinator ..> RuntimeStore
WritebackCoordinator ..> SheetsAccess
WritebackCoordinator ..> ClosedWinnerSnapshot
WritebackCoordinator ..> WritebackEvidence : structure / repeated-write checks
WritebackCoordinator ..> WritebackOperation : pending reconciliation
GuidedNotesService ..> SheetsAccess
GuidedNotesService ..> GuidedNotesSource
GuidedNotesService ..> PlaceholderLocation
ActivityService ..> GuidedNotesService
ActivityService ..> RuntimeStore
SubmissionService ..> RuntimeStore
SubmissionService ..> AuthorizationService
SynchronizationService ..> RuntimeStore
SynchronizationService ..> AuthorizationService
note bottom of PlaceholderLocation
  Import: whole-cell literal {{Q1}}..{{QN}}, unique and contiguous.
  Merged master only; formula results are not markers.
  Reject marker cells with partial-character formatting.
  No hardcoded spreadsheet or cell identities.
  Later checks accept recorded answer replacements using
  this activity's evidence / pending operation + imported mapping.
end note
note bottom of ActivityService
  Valid groups + complete source validation before one commit.
  No validated-source draft or additional draft state.
  Known non-editable source / answer cells: no activity commit.
  Unknown write permission: allow valid source with teacher warning.
  Check permissions without test writes.
end note
note bottom of WritebackOperation
  Logical operation status is NOT an Activity phase.
  At most one running/pending operation per activity.
  Unknown result keeps original snapshot for reconciliation.
  Matching text alone is not prior-success evidence.
end note
note bottom of Submission
  Existing quiz rules unchanged: server rank, one per group.
  Closed winner = minimum rank, no correctness check.
end note
note bottom of SheetsAccess
  Backend Service Account; credentials outside repository.
  Preflight + write is not a remote compare-and-set lock.
  Only target values change; other content/format preserved.
  Whole-cell styles and non-answer rich text remain intact.
end note
legend bottom
  Logical entities, not implementation signatures or SDK choices.
  Runtime operation/evidence may clear on restart; remote values remain.
  Prior Specify / cross-group confirmation retained: 2026-11-18.
  Clarify integrated version approved by user: 2026-11-18.
endlegend
@enduml
